ate_parts is not compatible with <code>quad=3Dtrue</code>, if you want to g=
enerate parts, please set <code>quad=3Dfalse</code>.</li></ul></li><li><cod=
e>export_uv</code> (Optional): Controls whether UV unwrapping is performed =
during generation. The default value is true. (When set to false, generatio=
n speed is significantly improved and model size is reduced. UV unwrapping =
will be handled during the texturing stage.)</li></ul><p>The options below =
