li><p><code>model_version</code> (Optional): Model version. Available versi=
ons are as below:</p><ul><li><code>P1-20260311</code> <a href=3D"https://pl=
atform.tripo3d.ai/docs/generation#p1-20260311" style=3D"text-decoration:und=
erline;margin-left:20px;">View supported parameter details</a></li><li><cod=
e>v3.1-20260211</code></li><li><code>v3.0-20250812</code></li><li><code>v2.=
5-20250123</code></li><li><code>v2.0-20240919</code></li><li><s><code>v1.4-=
20240625</code></s>(Deprecated)</li></ul><p>If this option is not set, the =
default value will be <code>v2.5-20250123</code>.</p></li><li><p><code>file=
s</code>: Specifies the image inputs, this is a list contains following par=
ameters. The list must contain exactly 4 items in the order [front, left, b=
ack, right]. You may omit certain input files by omitting the <code>file_to=
ken</code>, but the front input cannot be omitted. Do not use less than two=
 images to generate. The suggested resolution should be more than 256 x 256=
px.</p><ul><li><code>type</code>: Indicates the file type. Although current=
ly not validated, specifying the correct file type is strongly advised.</li=
><li><code>file_token</code>: The identifier you get from upload, please re=
ad <a href=3D"https://platform.tripo3d.ai/docs/upload">Docs/Upload</a>. Mut=
ually exclusive with <code>url</code> and <code>object</code>.</li><li><cod=
e>url</code>: A direct URL to the image. Supports JPEG and PNG formats with=
 maximum size of 20MB. Mutually exclusive with <code>file_token</code> and =
<code>object</code>.</li><li><code>object</code> (Strongly Recommended): Th=
e information you get from upload (STS), please read <a href=3D"https://pla=
tform.tripo3d.ai/docs/upload-sts">Docs/Upload (STS)</a>. Mutually exclusive=
 with <code>url</code> and <code>file_token</code>. <ul><li><code>bucket</c=
ode>: Normally should be <code>tripo-data</code>.</li><li><code>key</code>:=
 The resource_uri got from session token.</li></ul></li></ul></li><li><p><c=
ode>original_task_id</code> (Optional): The task_id from a previous multivi=
ew image task. Mutually exclusive with <code>files</code>.</p><ul><li>Only =
the task IDs of the tasks below are supported: <ul><li><a href=3D"https://p=
latform.tripo3d.ai/docs/generate-multiview-image#generate-multiview-image">=
generate_multiview_image</a></li><li><a href=3D"https://platform.tripo3d.ai=
/docs/generate-multiview-image#edit-multiview-image">edit_multiview_image</=
a></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><p><code>face_limit</code> (Optional): Limit=
s the number of faces on the output model. If this option is not set, the f=
ace limit will be adaptively determined. If <code>smart_low_poly=3Dtrue</co=
de>, it should be 1000~20000, if <code>quad=3Dtrue</code> as well, it shoul=
d be 500~10000.</p></li><li><p><code>texture</code> (Optional): A boolean o=
ption to enable texturing. The default value is <code>true</code>, set <cod=
e>false</code> to get a base model without any textures.</p></li><li><p><co=
de>pbr</code> (Optional): A boolean option to enable pbr. The default value=
