f this option is set to <code>true</code>, <code>texture</code> will be ign=
ored and used as <code>true</code>.</p></li><li><p><code>texture_seed</code=
> (Optional): This is the random seed for texture generation. Using the sam=
e seed will produce identical textures. This parameter is an integer and is=
