code> (Optional): Set <code>true</code> to enable quad mesh output. If <cod=
e>quad=3Dtrue</code> and <code>face_limit</code> is not set, the default <c=
ode>face_limit</code> will be 10000.</p><ul><li><em>Note</em>: Enabling thi=
s option will force the output to be an FBX model.</li></ul></li><li><p><co=
de>compress</code> (Optional): Specifies the compression type to apply to t=
he texture. Available values are:</p><ul><li><code>geometry</code>: Applies=
