><li><code>key</code>: The resource_uri got from session token.</li></ul></=
li></ul></li><li><code>enable_image_autofix</code> (Optional): When set to =
<code>true</code>, it will optimize the input image to get better generatio=
n result. The default value is <code>false</code>.</li><li><code>texture_al=
ignment</code> (Optional): Determines the prioritization of texture alignme=
nt in the 3D model. The default value is <code>original_image</code>. <ul><=
li><code>original_image</code>: Prioritizes visual fidelity to the source i=
mage. This option produces textures that closely resemble the original imag=
e but may result in minor 3D inconsistencies.</li><li><code>geometry</code>=
